# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What's public: the framework + the clean source lists.
# What's private: your voice, your annotations, your material.
#
# The convention: `*.template.md` is tracked, the working copy is not.
# Run `./scripts/init.sh` after cloning to create working copies.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Your codified voice — the most personal thing here, and the actual engine.
# Templates are tracked; these filled-in versions are not.
voice/style-guide.md
voice/voice-guide.md
voice/content-lessons.md

# Your annotations on the source lists — ⚡ marks and Read: notes are private
# editorial judgments about named people. The clean lists stay public.
sources/*.local.md

# Your raw material and output.
inputs/*
!inputs/README.md

drafts/*
!drafts/.gitkeep

published/*
!published/.gitkeep

# Unpublished ideas and their sources.
vault/ideas.md

# Discovery script output — regenerate with scripts/xhs_discover.mjs
xhs_authors.json

.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
*.local

# Local Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json
